WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.580
few days later, Gildong was in the town near the hideout.

2
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.041
The Hwalbindang were giving grain and cloth to the poor.

3
00:00:27.023 --> 00:00:29.263
Gildong!" an old man said.

4
00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:31.204
"You're our hero!"

5
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.621
Gildong smiled.

6
00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:39.786
He handed a sack of rice to the candlemaker.

7
00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.549
"Thank you for helping me again!"

8
00:00:42.929 --> 00:00:43.950
the young man said.

9
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:48.254
"I wish we could help more people," Nabi said.

10
00:00:48.274 --> 00:00:49.635
"Me too."

11
00:00:50.476 --> 00:00:51.396
Mok smiled.

12
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:54.159
"But we have only one boss.

13
00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:57.221
Wouldn't it be great if there were two Gildongs?"

14
00:00:58.883 --> 00:00:59.964
Gildong laughed.

15
00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:04.355
"Sorry. There's only one of me."

16
00:01:05.256 --> 00:01:08.278
But Mok's joke gave Gildong an idea.

17
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:16.343
Back at the hideout, he gathered some straw and started making something.

18
00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:21.947
When he was done, there were seven figures made of straw.

19
00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:26.630
Nabi laughed.

20
00:01:29.584 --> 00:01:30.884
"Can I play with your dolls?"

21
00:01:32.205 --> 00:01:34.425
"They're not dolls," Gildong said.

22
00:01:35.966 --> 00:01:37.106
He opened his fan.

23
00:01:37.126 --> 00:01:38.406
"Come to life!"

24
00:01:42.628 --> 00:01:44.648
The figures suddenly sprang up.

25
00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:51.010
Now they looked just like Gildong.

26
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.351
Nabi's eyes went wide.

27
00:01:54.371 --> 00:01:58.832
"Amazing!" "Whoa!"

28
00:01:59.344 --> 00:02:00.084
Mok cried.

29
00:02:00.104 --> 00:02:02.966
"There are seven more Gildongs!"

30
00:02:04.546 --> 00:02:07.988
Gildong nodded and turned back to his creations.

31
00:02:08.008 --> 00:02:11.790
"Each of you will lead a Hwalbindang group.

32
00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.431
Go out to every part of the country.

33
00:02:15.752 --> 00:02:16.592
Remember our role.

34
00:02:17.292 --> 00:02:19.413
We punish bad officials and help the poor."

35
00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:23.875
The Gildongs all puffed out their chests.

36
00:02:23.895 --> 00:02:25.436
"Yes, sir!"

37
00:02:31.652 --> 00:02:35.373
Every day the king heard new reports of the Hwalbindang.

38
00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:39.714
They robbed government storehouses all over the country.

39
00:02:40.495 --> 00:02:42.815
They stole from nobles everywhere.

40
00:02:46.656 --> 00:02:50.377
The king scowled when Police Chief Heup arrived at the palace.

41
00:02:54.338 --> 00:02:59.880
fool. You didn't capture Gildong, and now he seems to be everywhere!

42
00:03:01.568 --> 00:03:05.211
How can he be in eight places in one day?"

43
00:03:05.231 --> 00:03:08.233
"I'm sorry, Your Majesty."

44
00:03:09.073 --> 00:03:10.114
Heup looked down.

45
00:03:10.134 --> 00:03:13.577
"I have failed to capture Gildong so far.

46
00:03:14.417 --> 00:03:15.598
But I am on his trail.

47
00:03:16.919 --> 00:03:19.981
In fact, I just learned something new about the boy.

48
00:03:21.462 --> 00:03:24.604
Hong Gildong is the lowborn son of Lord Hong."

49
00:03:24.624 --> 00:03:29.228
"What?" the king roared.

50
00:03:30.112 --> 00:03:32.613
"Bring Lord Hong here now!"

51
00:03:32.633 --> 00:03:36.814
"Actually, sir," Heup said.

52
00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:39.735
"Perhaps we should place him under house arrest.

53
00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:44.276
When Gildong hears about the arrest, he'll go to his father's home."

54
00:03:47.157 --> 00:03:48.697
The king looked pleased.

55
00:03:48.717 --> 00:03:52.698
"We'll capture him then for sure!"

56
00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.666
One morning Gildong saw Nabi running to him.

57
00:04:05.389 --> 00:04:09.031
lord! I've heard terrible news about your father," she said.

58
00:04:09.051 --> 00:04:13.034
"The king found out you're Lord Hong's son.

59
00:04:14.095 --> 00:04:16.096
Your father is under house arrest."

60
00:04:18.238 --> 00:04:19.339
Gildong jumped up.

61
00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.480
"I have to go to him.

62
00:04:22.341 --> 00:04:23.381
I need to fix this."

63
00:04:25.443 --> 00:04:26.644
He took out his fan.

64
00:04:28.037 --> 00:04:29.346
"To Lord Hong's house!"
